    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "14 Clonshaugh Crescent is a charming three bedroom mid terrace family home and GWD Estates are thrilled to present this property to the Dublin 17 market This home has been carefully maintained by the current owners and is sure to impress whoever visits it and it will appeal to a variety of buyers.\r\nThe location is second to none and is close to a wide selection of both primary & Secondary schools and sporting facilities.  Northside Shopping Centre, Clarehall Shopping centre and Artaine Castle Shopping centre are all conveniently located. Beaumont hospital is also within a very short drive. There are numerous bus routes just a stroll away making access to the city centre easy and both the M50 and M1 are minutes away as is Dublin Airport.\r\nAccommodation: Entrance hallway with wooden floors and storage, sitting room with wooden floors and fireplace, dining room with wooden floors. Fitted kitchen with floor and wall presses and ceramic wall tiles, Upstairs there are 3 bedrooms and a newly fitted bathroom with a walk in shower. The property has newly fitted d/g Pvc windows throughout and has oil fire central heating. The back garden is walled and is private and is 40ft long with a small concrete garden shed and the front garden has a drive in.\r\nThis is a wonderful home set in a brilliant location in a much sought after area of Clonshaugh and viewing of this property is strongly advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway: 11'11'' x 6'11 Wooden floors with storage.\r\n\r\nSitting room: 13'7'' x 12'2'' Wooden floors with feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nLounge; 10'10'' x 10'8'' Wooden floors\r\n\r\nKitchen: 10'7'' x 8'5'' Fitted floor and wall presses with ceramic wall tiles and door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nLanding: Wooden floors with hot-press.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 12'2'' x 10'6'' Wooden floors with wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 12'3'' x 11'10'' Wooden floors(front room)\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 8'8'' x 8'5'' Wooden floors.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 6'7'' x 5'6'' Walk in shower, toilet and sink with ceramic floor and wall tiles.\r\n\r\nOutside Shed: 9'11'' x 8'2''"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
